{% extends "quarterly_deep_dive/llm_prompts/base_prompt.j2" %}

{# Specific context for the single callout in Section 7 (DoS/InfoDisc) #}
{% set output_format_description = "a brief callout (1-2 sentences) highlighting the most impactful insight about DoS or Info Disclosure vulnerabilities from the Section 7 data/insights, suitable for a distinct callout box" %}

{% block task_instructions %}
Review the data summary and chart insight provided below for "{{ section_title }}". This section focuses on Denial of Service (DoS) and Information Disclosure vulnerabilities.
Identify the *single most significant finding* about these types of vulnerabilities from this information. This could relate to their overall volume, a specific trend, or their potential cumulative impact.
Craft a concise callout (1-2 sentences maximum) stating this key finding clearly.
{% endblock task_instructions %}

{% block data_context %}
Section Key: {{ data_context_payload.section_key | default('section_7_dos_infodisc_deep_dive') }}

Insights Generated for Charts in this Section:
{% for chart_id, insight in data_context_payload.chart_insights_in_section.items() %}
- Insight for {{ chart_id }}: {{ insight }}
{% else %}
- No specific chart insights provided for this section.
{% endfor %}

Data Summaries for Charts in this Section:
{% for chart_id, summary in data_context_payload.charts_data_summaries_in_section.items() %}
--- Data Summary: {{ chart_id }} ---
{{ summary }}
--- End Summary ---
{% else %}
- No chart data summaries provided.
{% endfor %}
{% endblock data_context %}
